    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14058" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποτί̄μ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ἠ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pledging of a property,
				mortgaging,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				31.11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			= Lat. <i>census,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Crass.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				18.2.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>valuation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Just.
				<u>Nov.</u>
				2.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>tax,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AB
				437
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				476.2
			</span></i> (Dorylaeum, <span class="entity">i A.D.</span>).</div>
